############################# # Exercise Group Introduction #############################
BEGIN_PGML The percentage of births in the U.S. delivered via cesarean section in a year can be given by the formula [`p = 0.0042x^3-0.0529x^2+0.0212x+32.842`] where [`x`] is the number of years since 2010.
END_PGML
###### # Body ######
BEGIN_PGML What percent of births in the US in the year [$y] were cesarean deliveries?
[_]{$p}{10}
END_PGML
